# watchlist-scanner on a droplet — crontab -e and paste (server clock = UTC).
# scanner.py --mode auto gates by the US-Eastern window, so the doubled
# entries survive US DST: whichever lands in-window runs, the rest exit 3.
# UTC 13-22h = same-calendar-day US Eastern, so 1-5 (Mon-Fri) aligns with
# US trading days. --email inside run_scan.sh pushes the report.
#
# 投递闭环: 发信成功后 scanner 写 reports/{date}-{mode}.sent; 每次
# --email fire 先补发当日 .md 在而 .sent 不在的报告 (窗口外的 fire 也
# 补 — 投递不需要市场开着), watchdog 按 .sent 报"已写盘未送达"。
# 可选带外心跳: .env 里设 SCAN_HEARTBEAT_URL=https://hc-ping.com/<uuid>
# (healthchecks.io 建 1 day period / 12h grace 的 check) — 邮件商故障时
# FAILED/MISSED 告警和报告走同一条坏通道, 只有心跳服务能从外面报警。
45 13 * * 1-5 /opt/watchlist-scanner/deploy/run_scan.sh   # 09:45 EDT open  (US summer)
45 14 * * 1-5 /opt/watchlist-scanner/deploy/run_scan.sh   # 09:45 EST open  (US winter; EDT=10:45 also in-window, dedup skips)
45 19 * * 1-5 /opt/watchlist-scanner/deploy/run_scan.sh   # 15:45 EDT close (US summer)
45 20 * * 1-5 /opt/watchlist-scanner/deploy/run_scan.sh   # 15:45 EST close (US winter; EDT=16:45, skip)
30 22 * * 1-5 /opt/watchlist-scanner/deploy/run_scan.sh watchdog   # 报告缺失 -> 邮件报警
